      "title": "Inconsistent visit schedule: in-clinic visits every 4 weeks through week 16 conflicts with bi-weekly phone visits and training visits",
      "page": 26,
      "quote": "During the treatment period, patients will have in-clinic visits at week 2 and week 4, and then in-clinic visits every 4 weeks (Q4W) through week 16 with bi-weekly phone visits in between the in-clinic visits.  Patients and/or parents/caregivers will be trained on injecting study drug during in-clinic visit 2 (day 1) to visit 6 (week 4).",
      "severity": "major"
    },
